// Verified on hardware, firmware v1.0. See protocols/razer-naga-left-handed-2020.md.
//
// `at` places a button on the drawn mouse as [x, y], in percent of the view.
// The body is drawn at x 30..70, y 2..74; buttons left of x 30 or right of x 70 get a side plate.
// Leave `at` out on every button to get a plain grid instead.
